# =============================================================
# CHARACTER MOVE DATABASE
# =============================================================
# EFFECT FORMAT: TYPE:TARGET:VALUE:DURATION  (or TYPE:TARGET:TARGET_ID:VALUE:DURATION for ALLY_ID)
#
# DAMAGE:ENEMY:VALUE:0
#   Deals (character.damage * VALUE) to the enemy.
#   1.0 = 100% of damage stat. 1.75 = 175%. 2.0 = double, etc.
#
# HEAL:TARGET:VALUE:0
#   Heals (character.healing * VALUE) to the target.
#   Targets: SELF, LOWEST_HP_ALLY, ALL_PARTY
#
# BLOCK:TARGET:VALUE:0
#   Adds VALUE as flat block points to the target.
#   Targets: SELF, ALL_PARTY
#   e.g. BLOCK:ALL_PARTY:10.0:0 adds 10 block to everyone.
#
# BUFF_DAMAGE:TARGET:VALUE:DURATION
#   Multiplies target's damage by VALUE for DURATION turns.
#   e.g. 1.5 = +50% damage. Targets: SELF, ALLY_ID
#
# BUFF_DEFENSE:TARGET:VALUE:DURATION
#   Multiplies target's defense by VALUE for DURATION turns.
#   e.g. 1.5 = +50% defense.
#
# DEBUFF_DAMAGE:TARGET:VALUE:DURATION
#   Multiplies target's damage by VALUE for DURATION turns.
#   e.g. 0.5 = -50% damage.
#
# DEBUFF_DEFENSE:TARGET:VALUE:DURATION
#   Multiplies target's defense by VALUE for DURATION turns.
#   e.g. 0.5 = -50% defense.
#
# SELF_LOCK:SELF:0:DURATION
#   Locks the user out of acting for DURATION turns.
#
# ALLY_ID syntax: TYPE:ALLY_ID:CHARACTER_ID:VALUE:DURATION
#   e.g. BUFF_DAMAGE:ALLY_ID:PLAYER:1.5:4
#
# FIELDS:
# id | ownerId | buttonText | message | tip | sfxId | cooldown
#    | poseTexturePath | poseDurationTurns | effects | mpMax | levelRequirement
#
# mpMax: number of uses per combat. "infinite" = unlimited.
# levelRequirement: -1 = always available. 5 = requires level 5.
# =============================================================